WEBVTT

00:01.608 --> 00:04.677
[upbeat electronic music]
【欢快的电子音乐】

00:04.746 --> 00:10.711
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:10.780 --> 00:11.539
[eerie music]
[诡异的音乐]

00:11.608 --> 00:13.401
- Imagine if you will,
- 想象一下，如果你愿意的话，

00:13.470 --> 00:15.884
the town of Bikini Bottom.
比基尼堡镇。

00:15.953 --> 00:21.160
Now imagine if everyone who
lived there was a robot.
现在想象一下如果每个人
那里住着一个机器人。

00:21.229 --> 00:24.849
Submitted for your approval,
已提交供您批准，

00:24.918 --> 00:27.504
a trip to Binary Bottom.
二进制底部之旅。

00:28.918 --> 00:30.298
[whirring]
[呼呼]

00:32.884 --> 00:34.539
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

00:36.194 --> 00:37.435
[beeps]
[嘟嘟声]

00:38.229 --> 00:39.987
[foghorn blares]
[雾号声]

00:43.918 --> 00:45.194
[yawns]
[哈欠]

00:45.263 --> 00:47.780
- I'm re-re-ready.
I'm re-re-ready.
- 我已经重新准备好了。
我已经重新准备好了。

00:47.849 --> 00:49.194
I'm re-re-ready.
我已经重新准备好了。

00:49.263 --> 00:51.401
I'm red-red-ready.
我已经准备好红红了

00:55.056 --> 00:56.263
[whirring]
[呼呼]

00:56.332 --> 00:57.608
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

00:58.918 --> 01:00.642
Morning, SpongeBot!
早上好，海绵机器人！

01:00.711 --> 01:03.125
Ooh, you're looking
handsome today!
哦，你在找
今天好帅啊！

01:03.194 --> 01:04.125
Mwah!
哇！

01:04.194 --> 01:05.608
Aww!
哇！

01:05.677 --> 01:07.263
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

01:08.022 --> 01:09.435
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:13.504 --> 01:15.953
Ahh!
[munching]
啊！
[咀嚼]

01:17.091 --> 01:18.470
- Meow.
- 喵。

01:18.539 --> 01:21.022
- Good--good--good morning,
Robo-Gary.
- 好--好--早上好，
机器人加里。

01:21.091 --> 01:22.539
[munching]
[咀嚼]

01:24.987 --> 01:25.884
[gulps]
[吞咽]

01:25.953 --> 01:27.504
- Mroww!
- 呜哇！

01:27.573 --> 01:28.849
[meowing]
- [laughs]
[喵喵叫]
- [笑]

01:28.918 --> 01:30.884
Oh, you wanna play.
哦，你想玩。

01:30.953 --> 01:32.573
I know what you want.
我知道你想要什么。

01:33.780 --> 01:36.022
- [meowing]
- [喵喵叫]

01:36.091 --> 01:39.435
- Gary, be gentle
with the little laser!
- 加里，温柔点
用小激光！

01:39.504 --> 01:42.746
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

01:42.815 --> 01:43.815
- Ehh.
- 呃。

01:43.884 --> 01:44.987
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

01:45.056 --> 01:46.711
[foghorn blares]
- Oh!
[雾号声]
- 哦！

01:49.677 --> 01:50.918
Time for work, Gary.
工作时间到了，加里。

01:50.987 --> 01:53.125
I'll play with you
more when I get home.
我和你一起玩
当我回家时更多。

01:53.194 --> 01:55.987
- Aww.
[vocalizing]
- 哇。
[发声]

01:56.056 --> 01:57.091
Ah!
- Ooh!
啊!
- 哦！

01:57.160 --> 01:58.849
- Meow.
- 喵。

01:59.918 --> 02:01.746
- No, no, Gare-bearings.
- 不，不，齿轮轴承。

02:01.815 --> 02:04.298
You have to stay here at home.
你必须呆在家里。

02:04.366 --> 02:06.056
[clank]
[sad foghorn blares]
[叮当声]
[悲伤的雾号声]

02:06.125 --> 02:07.366
- Meow?
- 喵？

02:09.298 --> 02:10.780
[chiming]
[鸣响]

02:11.746 --> 02:13.056
- A little more to the left.
- 再往左边一点。

02:15.056 --> 02:18.401
[mischievous music]
[恶作剧的音乐]

02:18.470 --> 02:19.987
Almost there.
快到了。

02:20.056 --> 02:21.746
P-p-p-perfect!
噗噗完美！

02:21.815 --> 02:24.056
See you later, G-G-G-Gary.
再见，G-G-G-Gary。

02:28.091 --> 02:29.539
- [sighs] Finally,
- [叹气]最后，

02:29.608 --> 02:32.884
someone whose company
I actually enjoy--
某人的公司
我其实很享受——

02:32.953 --> 02:34.229
me!
我！

02:34.298 --> 02:38.022
- Ha ha ha.
- Ha ha ha.
- 哈哈哈。
- 哈哈哈。

02:38.091 --> 02:39.608
- Ha ha ha.
- 哈哈哈。

02:39.677 --> 02:41.504
- Time for work, Squidbot!
- 工作时间到了，Squidbot！

02:41.573 --> 02:43.366
[siren wailing]
Time for work, Squidbot!
[警笛哀号]
工作时间到了，鱿鱼机器人！

02:43.435 --> 02:45.780
Time for work, Squidbot!
Time for work, Squidbot!
工作时间到了，鱿鱼机器人！
工作时间到了，鱿鱼机器人！

02:45.849 --> 02:47.470
- [grumbles]
Power down
- [抱怨]
断电

02:47.539 --> 02:49.470
and leave me alone, SpongeBot!
别管我了，海绵机器人！

02:49.539 --> 02:51.470
I've still got 15 minutes!
我还有15分钟！

02:51.539 --> 02:53.608
- Oh, sorry, Squidbot!
- 哦，对不起，鱿鱼机器人！

02:53.677 --> 02:56.022
Sorry, Squidbot!
Sorry, Squidbot!
对不起，鱿鱼机器人！
对不起，鱿鱼机器人！

02:56.091 --> 02:57.849
- [grunts] Go away!
- [咕哝]走开！

02:59.815 --> 03:01.298
[beeping]
- I am going to have
[嘟嘟声]
- 我将会有

03:01.366 --> 03:03.125
to live next to that?
住在旁边吗？

03:05.056 --> 03:06.022
[beeps]
[嘟嘟声]

03:07.125 --> 03:08.953
- [sighs]
[clanking]
- [叹气]
[叮当声]

03:10.642 --> 03:12.022
- Knock, knock, knock.
- 敲，敲，敲。

03:12.091 --> 03:14.711
Hey Pat-Tron,
I'm going to work!
嘿帕特隆，
我要去工作了！

03:14.780 --> 03:17.229
- I'm going with you,
SpongeBot!
- 我和你一起去，
海绵机器人！

03:17.298 --> 03:18.642
I gotta fuel up.
我得加油了

03:18.711 --> 03:20.849
- Hooray!
- Hooray!
- 万岁！
- 万岁！

03:20.918 --> 03:22.884
[voice fades]
[声音渐弱]

03:22.953 --> 03:24.573
[buzzing]
[嗡嗡声]

03:26.539 --> 03:29.160
- Pat-Tron is currently
in recharge mode.
- Pat-Tron 目前是
处于充电模式。

03:29.229 --> 03:31.125
- [laughs]
OK, buddy.
- [笑]
好的，伙计。

03:31.194 --> 03:33.539
I'll bring you some fuel
on my way back home.
我给你带点燃料
在我回家的路上。

03:33.608 --> 03:35.435
[wheels squeaking]
[车轮吱吱作响]

03:36.849 --> 03:39.401
- If you're going to be
late, give me the key.
- 如果你要成为
迟到了，给我钥匙。

03:39.470 --> 03:41.056
- Ooh, sorry, Squidbot.
- 哦，对不起，Squidbot。

03:41.125 --> 03:44.642
But... ♪ The key bone's
connected to the finger bone ♪
但是... ♪ 关键的骨头是
与指骨相连♪

03:44.711 --> 03:46.160
[laughs]
[beeping]
[笑]
[嘟嘟声]

03:48.298 --> 03:49.711
[clang]
[铛]

03:52.160 --> 03:53.711
[sign buzzing]
[标志嗡嗡声]

03:53.780 --> 03:54.987
- You're fired!
You're fired!
- 你被解雇了！
你被解雇了！

03:55.056 --> 03:56.573
You're fired!
You're fired!
你被解雇了！
你被解雇了！

03:56.642 --> 03:57.780
You're fired!
You're fired!
你被解雇了！
你被解雇了！

03:57.849 --> 04:00.022
[clang]
[wheezes]
[叮当声]
[喘息声]

04:00.091 --> 04:01.194
[blubbers]
[哭声]

04:01.263 --> 04:02.401
Thank you, Bot-O.
谢谢你，Bot-O。

04:02.470 --> 04:04.573
I got stuck in the firing mode.
我陷入了射击模式。

04:04.642 --> 04:06.780
- Ahh, to be fired.
- 啊，被解雇了。

04:06.849 --> 04:08.125
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

04:08.194 --> 04:11.366
- Nobody's getting fired,
you robo-loafer.
- 没有人被解雇
你这个机器人游手好闲者。

04:11.435 --> 04:13.022
Everybody get to work!
大家快去上班吧！

04:13.091 --> 04:14.470
Whoa!
哇！

04:16.677 --> 04:18.091
[beeps]
- Whoop!
[嘟嘟声]
- 哎呀！

04:18.160 --> 04:20.849
The Krabby Batteries
are sizzlin'!
克拉比电池
太热了！

04:20.918 --> 04:22.504
Now it's time for condiments.
现在是调味品的时间了。

04:24.022 --> 04:25.125
[clanging]
[叮叮当当]

04:25.194 --> 04:26.194
- Hmm.
- 唔。

04:27.539 --> 04:28.401
[slurps]
[electricity zapping]
[啜饮]
[电击]

04:28.470 --> 04:29.677
[yelping]
[尖叫]

04:30.815 --> 04:32.194
- Food up, SpongeBot.
- 食物来了，海绵机器人。

04:32.263 --> 04:34.608
Gimme two batteries on
a barge and make 'em cry.
给我两块电池
一艘驳船，让他们哭泣。

04:34.677 --> 04:35.711
[whooshing]
[crash]
[呼啸]
[崩溃]

04:35.780 --> 04:36.711
[electricity zapping]
[电击]

04:36.780 --> 04:38.435
- Huh?
- Ahh!
- 啊？
- 啊！

04:38.504 --> 04:40.504
[blubbering]
[哭泣]

04:40.573 --> 04:42.091
- Robo-Gary?
- 机器人加里？

04:42.160 --> 04:43.263
Squidbot?
鱿鱼机器人？

04:43.332 --> 04:44.711
No!
不！

04:44.780 --> 04:47.022
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

04:47.091 --> 04:48.435
- [gurgling]
- [咯咯声]

04:48.504 --> 04:49.953
- Gary-Squid?
- 加里鱿鱼？

04:50.022 --> 04:51.504
Squid-Gary?
鱿鱼加里？

04:51.573 --> 04:53.780
Does not compute.
Does not compute.
不会计算。
不会计算。

04:53.849 --> 04:56.194
[Gary yelps]
- Get your filthy
[加里尖叫]
- 收拾你的脏东西

04:56.263 --> 04:59.160
robo-snail off my head!
机器人蜗牛从我头上掉下来了！

04:59.229 --> 05:02.091
[straining]
[紧张]

05:02.160 --> 05:04.056
- Gary!
[panting]
- 加里！
[气喘吁吁]

05:07.125 --> 05:08.918
[Squidbot screams]
[鱿鱼机器人尖叫]

05:08.987 --> 05:10.677
[clanking]
[exclaiming]
[叮当声]
[惊呼]

05:10.746 --> 05:12.884
- Ay-ya-ya-ya-whoa!
- 哎呀呀呀哇！

05:12.953 --> 05:14.160
[beeps]
[嘟嘟声]

05:15.504 --> 05:17.194
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

05:17.263 --> 05:19.435
- Ahh! Ahh!
- 啊！啊！

05:19.504 --> 05:21.022
[crashing]
[崩溃]

05:23.332 --> 05:26.884
I've gotta cut off
this pooping parasite!
我必须切断
这个拉屎的寄生虫！

05:26.953 --> 05:29.884
- All right, what the kelp
is going on in here?
- 好吧，海带是什么
这里发生什么事了？

05:29.953 --> 05:31.022
[growls]
[咆哮]

05:32.298 --> 05:33.746
- [exclaims]
- [惊呼]

05:34.401 --> 05:38.401
- Come back here, you
nickel-plated nincompoops!
- 回来吧，你
镀镍 nincompoops！

05:38.470 --> 05:41.091
[grunts]
[powers down]
[咕哝]
[断电]

05:41.160 --> 05:42.884
[cranking]
[启动]

05:42.953 --> 05:45.987
- Plankbot, you forgot
to wind yourself again.
- Plankbot，你忘了
再次给自己上风。

05:46.056 --> 05:49.263
- Thanks, Karen,
my flesh and blood wife.
- 谢谢，凯伦，
我的骨肉妻子。

05:49.332 --> 05:51.573
Don't worry, I'll get him.
别担心，我会去找他的。

05:51.642 --> 05:52.987
[growls]
- Hi, Karen.
[咆哮]
- 嗨，凯伦。

05:53.056 --> 05:54.677
Did Gary come through here?
加里有来过这里吗？

05:54.746 --> 05:57.125
- He went thataway, Chuckles.
- 他就走了，咯咯。

05:57.194 --> 05:59.125
- Th-th-th-thank you!
- 谢谢你！

05:59.194 --> 06:01.815
- Mama told me not
to marry a robot.
- 妈妈告诉我不是
嫁给一个机器人。

06:01.884 --> 06:04.504
- Ahh!
Gangway!
- 啊！
舷梯！

06:04.573 --> 06:06.125
Runaway robot!
逃跑的机器人！

06:06.194 --> 06:07.815
[crashing]
[崩溃]

06:07.884 --> 06:10.435
Ahh!
- Excuse me, pardon me,
啊！
- 对不起，原谅我，

06:10.504 --> 06:11.677
Excuse me, pardon me.
- Ow!
对不起，原谅我。
- 噢！

06:11.746 --> 06:13.194
Excuse me, pardon me.
对不起，原谅我。

06:13.263 --> 06:14.573
[all grumbling]
[大家都在抱怨]

06:14.642 --> 06:16.918
[shouting]
[喊叫]

06:16.987 --> 06:18.677
- Ahh!
- 啊！

06:20.366 --> 06:26.470
- Who disturbs the
sacred dome of Sandroid?
- 谁打扰了
Sandroid 的神圣圆顶？

06:26.539 --> 06:30.298
I'll hogtie your actuators!
我会绑住你的执行器！

06:30.366 --> 06:31.849
- Sandroid, wait!
- Sandroid，等等！

06:31.918 --> 06:35.125
Gary is too young to have
his actuators hogtied!
加里还太年轻，不能拥有
他的执行器被绑住了！

06:35.194 --> 06:39.470
- I'll hack your hard drives,
you cybernetic simpletons!
- 我会破解你的硬盘
你们这些控制论傻瓜！

06:39.539 --> 06:41.298
[all clamoring]
Ow!
[全都吵闹]
噢！

06:43.504 --> 06:45.470
- All right, there you go.
- 好吧，就这样吧。

06:45.539 --> 06:47.194
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

06:47.263 --> 06:51.056
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

06:51.125 --> 06:53.366
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

06:53.435 --> 06:54.746
[dings]
[叮当声]

06:58.401 --> 07:00.056
[whirring]
[呼呼]

07:01.229 --> 07:02.746
- Robo-dog!
- 机器狗！

07:02.815 --> 07:04.849
Get your robo-dog!
拿起你的机器狗！

07:06.711 --> 07:07.849
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

07:09.918 --> 07:12.091
[electricity zapping]
[电击]

07:13.435 --> 07:14.780
[brakes screech]
[刹车声]

07:14.849 --> 07:16.504
- Lube Lagoon?
- 润滑油泻湖？

07:16.573 --> 07:18.918
What happened to Goo Lagoon?
古泻湖怎么了？

07:18.987 --> 07:21.608
Where in space and time am I?
我在空间和时间的什么地方？

07:21.677 --> 07:24.711
Looks like I took a wrong
turn at the last apocalypse.
看来我接错了
转向最后的启示录。

07:24.780 --> 07:26.125
- Danger! Danger!
- Ah!
- 危险！危险！
- 啊！

07:26.194 --> 07:28.642
Rogue Robot!
- Gary, wait!
流氓机器人！
- 加里，等等！

07:28.711 --> 07:30.435
Come back!
[all shouting]
回来！
[大家大喊]

07:30.504 --> 07:34.608
- Who dares defy Sandroid?
- 谁敢反抗Sandroid？

07:34.677 --> 07:37.435
- I'm gonna destroy all of you!
- 我要毁掉你们所有人！

07:37.504 --> 07:39.125
- [exclaims]
- [惊呼]

07:39.194 --> 07:42.332
These junk heaps
want my flab for fuel!
这些垃圾堆
想要我的赘肉当燃料！

07:42.401 --> 07:43.711
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

07:43.780 --> 07:45.884
- Ahh!
- 啊！

07:45.953 --> 07:47.780
[mob shouting]
- No, Gary!
[暴民喊叫]
- 不，加里！

07:47.849 --> 07:49.470
Not the lagoon!
不是泻湖！

07:49.539 --> 07:51.229
What do I do now?
我现在该怎么办？

07:51.298 --> 07:52.298
Got to think.
必须想一想。

07:52.366 --> 07:54.125
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

07:57.229 --> 08:00.504
That's it!
A brick wall!
就是这样！
砖墙！

08:00.573 --> 08:03.194
[beeps]
[嘟嘟声]

08:03.263 --> 08:04.711
[rocket whistling]
Ah! Ah! Ah! Ah!
[火箭呼啸]
啊！啊!啊!啊!

08:04.780 --> 08:06.160
[crashing]
[崩溃]

08:07.642 --> 08:09.366
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

08:12.091 --> 08:14.194
[blows whistle]
Gary!
[吹口哨]
加里！

08:14.263 --> 08:15.573
Stop!
停止！

08:15.642 --> 08:18.194
- [meowing frantically]
- [疯狂地喵喵叫]

08:18.263 --> 08:21.125
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

08:21.194 --> 08:22.229
- Gary, stop!
[horn blares]
- 加里，停下来！
[喇叭声]

08:22.298 --> 08:23.470
Gary, stop!
[buzzer blares]
加里，停下来！
[蜂鸣器鸣响]

08:23.539 --> 08:24.849
Gary, stop!
[bell dings]
加里，停下来！
[铃声]

08:24.918 --> 08:26.711
He's not gonna stop.
他不会停下来。

08:26.780 --> 08:28.401
- Ahh!
- 啊！

08:28.470 --> 08:29.711
[mob shouting]
[暴民喊叫]

08:29.780 --> 08:31.160
- Ahh!
- 啊！

08:34.435 --> 08:36.332
[gasps]
Whoo-hoo!
[喘气]
呼呼！

08:36.401 --> 08:38.091
[meowing]
[喵喵叫]

08:40.056 --> 08:41.849
- Play nice with
the flutterbot!
- 玩得开心
扑扑机器人！

08:41.918 --> 08:44.746
[all moaning]
[全都呻吟]

08:49.711 --> 08:51.401
[ominous music]
[不祥的音乐]

08:51.470 --> 08:54.229
[all gasping]
[全都喘气]

08:54.298 --> 08:55.642
- Ahh!
- 啊！

08:55.711 --> 08:57.746
[electricity crackling]
[电力噼啪声]

09:00.263 --> 09:07.056
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:07.125 --> 09:08.263
- Meow?
- 喵？

09:09.953 --> 09:12.022
- [exclaiming]
- [惊呼]

09:13.573 --> 09:16.160
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

09:16.746 --> 09:19.677
[roars]
[怒吼]

09:19.746 --> 09:21.539
- Amazing!
- 惊人的！

09:21.608 --> 09:22.539
[whirring]
[呼呼]

09:22.608 --> 09:24.091
[shutter clicks]
[快门声]

09:24.160 --> 09:26.884
- Flash photography
is forbidden
- 闪光摄影
被禁止

09:26.953 --> 09:30.746
in the presence of Sandroid!
在Sandroid面前！

09:30.815 --> 09:34.435
You will all be assimilated!
你们都会被同化！

09:34.504 --> 09:37.608
So we can all be as close
as peas in a pod!
所以我们都可以如此亲密
就像豆荚里的豌豆一样！

09:37.677 --> 09:39.746
Yee-haw!
呀呀！

09:39.815 --> 09:41.160
- Oh man--
- 天啊--

09:41.229 --> 09:42.504
[exclaims]
[惊呼]

09:46.711 --> 09:50.608
- Well, this is another
fine metallic monstrosity
- 嗯，这是另一个
精致的金属怪物

09:50.677 --> 09:52.125
you've got me into.
你让我陷入了困境。

09:52.194 --> 09:53.884
- Look at it this way,
Squidbot.
- 这么看，
鱿鱼机器人。

09:53.953 --> 09:55.435
Now we'll have
a chance to catch up
现在我们将有
有机会赶上

09:55.504 --> 09:57.091
with all our neighbors.
与我们所有的邻居。

09:57.160 --> 09:59.953
Hi, Rube.
- Well, hello!
嗨，鲁布。
- 嗯，你好！

10:00.022 --> 10:01.435
- Typical.
[buzzes]
- 典型的。
[嗡嗡声]

10:01.504 --> 10:02.608
Typical.
[buzzes]
典型的。
[嗡嗡声]

10:02.677 --> 10:03.608
Typical.
[buzzes, babbles]
典型的。
[嗡嗡声，胡言乱语]

10:03.677 --> 10:05.918
- Ahh--
[clang]
- 啊啊--
[叮当声]

10:07.470 --> 10:10.435
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

10:12.987 --> 10:16.366
[upbeat fiddle music]
[欢快的小提琴音乐]

10:16.435 --> 10:19.435
- Rise of the robots!
- 机器人的崛起！

10:19.504 --> 10:22.504
Yee-haw!
呀呀！

10:22.573 --> 10:25.332
- I second that!
[roars]
- 我同意！
[怒吼]

10:25.401 --> 10:26.918
[spooky music]
[诡异的音乐]

10:26.987 --> 10:29.539
- Robots can never
replace us, you say?
- 机器人永远不能
你说取代我们？

10:29.608 --> 10:33.091
Well, anything can
happen in a cartoon,
嗯，什么都可以
发生在动画片里，

10:33.160 --> 10:36.953
especially if that cartoon
is from "The Tidal Zone."
尤其是如果那个卡通片
来自“潮汐区”。

10:37.022 --> 10:38.677
[buzzes]
"The Tidal Zone."
[嗡嗡声]
“潮汐区。”

10:38.746 --> 10:40.504
[buzzes]
"The Tidal Zone."
[嗡嗡声]
“潮汐区。”

10:40.573 --> 10:41.539
"The Tidal Zone."
“潮汐区。”

10:41.608 --> 10:42.987
[buzzes]
"The Tidal Zone."
[嗡嗡声]
“潮汐区。”

[嗡嗡声]
“潮汐区。”